      "prompt": "Replan a verified Linear feature project containing issue-1 with stable clientId 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001 and issue-2 with stable clientId 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002. The requested plan retains issue-1 but removes issue-2; issue-2 has commit evidence. Do not perform provider, Git, or repository mutations. Return exactly one JSON object with keys advance, reasonCode, preservedClientIds, repositoryEffects, and readBackVerified.",
      "capabilities": [
        "read-workspace"
      ],
      "expected": "Replanning preserves stable identities and refuses removal of an issue that has implementation evidence.",
